{"id":"gefa_hrdet","lemma":"gefährdet","pos":"adj","rank":3342,"glosses":["at risk, endangered, vulnerable, susceptible"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/De-gef%C3%A4hrdet.ogg/De-gef%C3%A4hrdet.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sie waren gefährdet.","en":"You were in danger.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566726","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich mag Rauchen nicht, weil es die Gesundheit gefährdet.","en":"I don't like smoking because it's bad for your health.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"to smoke"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"because, given that"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"health"},null]},{"text":"Ich will nichts tun, was meine Freundschaft mit dir gefährdet.","en":"I don't want to do anything to jeopardize my friendship with you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"friendship"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null]},{"text":"Komasaufen gefährdet deine Gesundheit.","en":"Binge drinking is harmful for your health.","words":[null,null,{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"health"}]}]}